#: ../../integration_guides/Networking/infoblox.rst:50
msgid ""
"This can be set to the name of the extended attribute in Infoblox where "
"|morpheus| will check for the id of a morpheus tenant.  This allows for "
"setting the tenant’s |morpheus| id to an extended attribute field on a "
"network view or network in Infoblox, and when the network or view is "
"discovered by morpheus, it will be auto assigned to the right tenant."
msgstr ""
"This se puede establecer to el nombre of el extended atributo in Infoblox"
" donde |morpheus| será check para el id of un morpheus tenant.  This "
"allows para setting el inquilino’s |morpheus| id to un extended atributo "
"campo on una red view o network in Infoblox, y cuando la red o view es "
"discovered by morpheus, it será be auto assigned to el right tenant."

